    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeDiscordButton">Open Playnite Discord</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP1Title">Welcome to OneMenu!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP1Intro">OneMenu adds a button to Playnite's sidebar that opens your very own flyout menu: shortcuts to your filter presets, files and folders, plus a Tag Browser and a Tags and Genre Manager. This short guide walks you through the essentials.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP1Step1">Click the arrow on the right to turn the page, and the arrow on the left to go back.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP1Step2">The left and right arrow keys on your keyboard work too.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP1Step3">You can open this guide again at any time with the "Show guide" button in the OneMenu settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP2Title">Opening the OneMenu settings</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP2Intro">Everything in OneMenu is set up in one place: the add-on settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP2Step1">Open Playnite's main menu and choose "Add-ons..." (or simply press F9).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP2Step2">On the left, go to Extensions settings &gt; Generic &gt; OneMenu.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP2Step3">Make your changes and click "Save". Your menu is updated right away, no restart needed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP3Title">Building your menu</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP3Intro">Your flyout menu is made of categories and the items inside them.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP3Step1">Click "Add category" to create a new top-level entry.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP3Step2">Select it and click "Add sub-item" to put items inside. An entry with sub-items becomes an expandable category.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP3Step3">Give every entry a title and choose whether it shows an icon, text, or both.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP3Step4">Use "Move up" and "Move down" to change the order, and "Hide Button" to hide an entry without deleting it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP4Title">Filter presets and shortcuts</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP4Intro">Every item can either apply one of your Playnite filter presets or open a file or folder.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP4Step1">First create a preset in Playnite itself: open the filter panel, set the filters you want and save them as a preset.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP4Step2">Back in OneMenu, select an item, choose "Apply a filter preset" and pick your preset from the list.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP4Step3">Or choose "Open a file or folder" to start a program, play a video or open any folder instead.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP5Title">Icons</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP5Intro">Icons make your menu easier to read at a glance.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP5Step1">"Browse..." lets you pick an image from your computer. It is copied into your OneMenu icon library.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP5Step2">"Library..." opens a window with all icons you have added before, so you can reuse them.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP5Step3">"Set Icon" changes the OneMenu button in Playnite's sidebar.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP5Step4">Under ADV-Settings &gt; Manage Icons you can view all icons, add new ones and permanently delete the ones you no longer need.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP6Title">Tag Browser</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP6Intro">Find games by tag or genre within seconds.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP6Step1">Tick "Tag Browser" in the OneMenu settings to enable it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP6Step2">Open it and type part of a tag or genre. All matching games appear with their covers.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP6Step3">Left-click a game to launch it, right-click it for more options.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP6Step4">Transparency and window size can be changed under ADV-Settings &gt; Tag Browser, the color scheme under ADV-Settings &gt; Theme.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP7Title">Tags and Genre Manager</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP7Intro">Keep your tags and genres tidy. You will find it under ADV-Settings &gt; T&amp;G Manager.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP7Step1">Double-click an entry to rename or remove it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP7Step2">Select several entries and click "Merge...", or drag them onto another entry, to combine them into one.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP7Step3">Select games in the list on the right to add or remove a tag or genre for many games at once.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP8Title">Buttons, theme and backups</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP8Intro">A few more things that are good to know.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP8Step1">ADV-Settings &gt; UI Settings: show the Tag Browser in the flyout menu, in Playnite's top panel or both, and add a T&amp;G Manager button to the top panel.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP8Step2">ADV-Settings &gt; Theme: choose separately for the Advanced Settings and for the Tag Browser whether they use OneMenu's own colors or your Playnite theme.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP8Step3">ADV-Settings &gt; Import &amp; Export: back up your menu, icons, tags and genres, or move them to another PC.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP9Title">You're all set!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeP9Intro">That's everything you need to know. Open the OneMenu settings, create your first category and have fun!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuSideButton">Set as left side button</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuSideButtonHint">Shows this entry as an icon-only button right below the OneMenu button in Playnite's sidebar instead of inside the flyout menu. Without an icon, the first letter of the title is shown. Takes effect after saving.</sys:String>
