    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuAdvThemeSectionTagBrowser">Tag Browser theme</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuAdvTagBrowserThemeMoved">The color scheme of the Tag Browser can be changed under Theme.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeSideTitle">Left side buttons</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeSideIntro">Put your most important shortcuts directly into Playnite's sidebar, just one click away.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeSideStep1">Select an entry in the OneMenu settings and tick "Set as left side button". The display mode is greyed out because side buttons always show only their icon.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeSideStep2">After saving, the entry appears as an icon button right below the OneMenu button and no longer inside the flyout menu. Give it an icon so it is easy to recognize.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCOneMenuWelcomeSideStep3">A single item runs its action right away, while an entry with sub-items opens them as a small menu. Up to 15 side buttons are possible. The number in front of an entry shows its position below the OneMenu button, and the arrow buttons next to it change the order.</sys:String>
